  "text": [
    {
      "text": "As shown in Eq. 5 and discussed in Section 2, the effect was large, t(28) = 2.10, p <.05, d = 0.8.",
      "text_id": 1,
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "section_id": 2,
      "page_number": null,
      "formatted": null
    },
    {
      "text": "See the Supplementary Material and Table S2 for details.",
      "text_id": 2,
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "section_id": 2,
      "page_number": null,
      "formatted": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The mathematical italic 𝛼 = 0.05 criterion was used, as in Figure 1.",
      "text_id": 3,
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "section_id": 2,
      "page_number": null,
      "formatted": null
    },
    {
      "text": "We collected data from 40 people. Results are in Table 1.",
      "text_id": 4,
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "section_id": 3,
      "page_number": null,
      "formatted": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Smith, J. (2020). A prior study. Journal of Things, 7, 10-20. https://doi.org/10.1234/PRIOR",
      "text_id": 5,
      "paragraph_id": 3,
